# Rename this to `.github/CODEOWNERS` and replace the placeholder handles with
# real GitHub users/teams to auto-request reviewers on PRs (incl. agent PRs).
# (Shipped as .example so the placeholder owner doesn't error in GitHub.)
# First matching pattern wins.

# Default owner for everything
*                       @your-github-username

# Per-area (examples — adjust as the team grows)
/backend/               @your-github-username
/apps/                  @your-github-username
/packages/contracts/    @your-github-username
/infra/                 @your-github-username
/.github/               @your-github-username
